(DRAFT#32)(I)(E)(m)(2)&emsp;In the executive summary, I have very briefly elucidated one of the major fraudulent schemes orchestrated by McDonald's, showcasing a level of deceit so sophisticated that even the most astute consumers could not discern the fraudulent machinations at play.

(DRAFT#32)(I)(E)(m)(3)&emsp;

