</table>

(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(80)&emsp;This translates to approximately 99 '<span class="double-strike">M</span>' for every purchase that would yield an '<span class="double-strike">M</span>' game stamp. Indeed: 3,491,499,990 / 35,149,999 ≈ 99.33. To simplify the demonstration, let's round it down to 99.

(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(81)&emsp;However, upon calculating the total value in '<span class="double-strike">M</span>' bills of the prizes on offer, one can startlingly ascertain that the total only amounts to 59,190,000 '<span class="double-strike">M</span>' (as seen in the table below).

(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(82)&emsp;

