(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(148)&emsp;After reaching out to Google for clarification, I learned from a representative that McDonald's had lodged a complaint against my advertising campaign, leading to its suspension.

(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(149)&emsp;The implications of McDonald's actions are profound and deeply concerning. By not only perpetrating the fraud but also actively working to silence those who sought to expose it, McDonald's violated the rights of victims—rights to freedom of assembly and association as outlined in Article 11 of the European Convention on Human Rights.

