(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(190)&emsp;Upon discovering her public declaration about reporting my account, I approached Ms Josset via direct message, presenting a screenshot of her Facebook comment, and inquired about whom she had reported me to.

![Josset states she reported my account](images/2016-mcdonalds-france-frauds/Screen_Shot_2016-10-31_at_14.15.54_IMPORTANT_JOSSET_JAI_SIGNALE_SON_COMPTE_copy_REFRAMED_REDACTED.png)

