(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(192)&emsp;She remained silent in response. If my memory serves me right, in what appears to be a deliberate act of evidence destruction, she subsequently deleted her Facebook account.

(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(193)&emsp;Destroying evidence, especially when one is aware or suspects their involvement in criminal activities, is a serious offense. This act further implicates Ms. Josset in the broader conspiracy to obstruct justice.

