(DRAFT#32)(IV)(EE)(200)&emsp;So why single me out? Was it because I presented the most cogent arguments underscoring McDonald's criminal activities? A possible hint lies in a screenshot wherein Mr. Le Faucheur falsely accuses me of hacking. His accusation triggered an investigation into me. Refer to the screenshot taken on 2016-10-31 at 21.05.04 for evidence:

